  "prefLabel": "He-P 4024.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4024.01 Purpose.\n\n(a) This part provides information for the licensee on removing the waste safely from a facility or site containing radioactive material, a radiation-producing machine, or radioactivity-inducing machine, pursuant to He-P 4030 through 4036, He-P 4039, He-P 4040, He-P 4044, and He-P 4047.\n\n(b) The purpose of this part is to conform with 10 CFR 20.1401 – 20.1406, 10 CFR 30.35, 10 CFR 30.36, 10 CFR 40.36, 10 CFR 40.42, 10 CFR 70.25, and 10 CFR 70.38.\n\nSource. #8393, eff 7-23-05; ss by #10492, eff 12-24-13; ss by #13997, eff 6-12-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4023-4039.html"
